      "offsetInSection": 276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544BCF4B2940020C5B4B514AE4CC9C0AC000020AF2CB9ACC7780020AC78AE4CC694003F001000020114012A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "만져 보면 알 수 있을지도 몰라요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9CCC8380020BCF4BA740020C54C0020C2180020C788C744C9C0B3C40020BAB0B77CC6940021001000020114012A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "엄마가 와일드 존의 포켓몬은\n위험하다고 했지만...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5C4B9C8AC000020C640C77CB4DC0020C874C7580020D3ECCF13BAACC740000AC704D5D8D558B2E4ACE00020D588C9C0B9CC002E002E002E001000020114012A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "트레이너님의 포켓몬이라면\n괜찮지 않을까요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B8B808C774B108B2D8C7580020D3ECCF13BAACC774B77CBA74000AAD1CCC2EC9C00020C54AC744AE4CC694003F001000020114012A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아보를 잡으면\n저도 만지게 해 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544BCF4B97C0020C7A1C73CBA74000AC800B3C40020B9CCC9C0AC8C0020D5740020C8FCC138C6940021001000020114012A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
