      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아보도 자기 꼬리가\n촉감이 좋은 걸 알고 있지 않을까요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544BCF4B3C40020C790AE300020AF2CB9ACAC00000ACD09AC10C7740020C88BC7400020AC780020C54CACE00020C788C9C00020C54AC744AE4CC694003F001000020114012A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "샤아~♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0E4C544007E266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아보의 꼬리를 만지면\n언제든지 행복해질 수 있을 것 같았어요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544BCF4C7580020AF2CB9ACB97C0020B9CCC9C0BA74000AC5B8C81CB4E0C9C00020D589BCF5D574C9C80020C2180020C788C7440020AC830020AC19C558C5B4C6940021001000020114012A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저도 아보를 잡아서\n행복한 꼬리 타임을 영원히 즐길 거예요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
